## Notification system

This fleet uses [`claude-code-fleet-notify`](https://github.com/palios-taey/claude-code-fleet-notify) (≥ v1.0.1):
- Inbox: `redis-cli -h 127.0.0.1 LRANGE taey:<session>:inbox 0 -1`
- Send: `taey-notify <target-session> "<body>" --from <your-session> [--type message|command|escalation|defect]`
- Acknowledge: `taey-ack` (drains your own inbox)
- Protocol spec: [docs/NOTIFICATION_PROTOCOL.md](https://github.com/palios-taey/claude-code-fleet-notify/blob/main/NOTIFICATION_PROTOCOL.md)

## Orchestrator dispatch

Use [`claude-code-fleet-orchestrator`](https://github.com/palios-taey/claude-code-fleet-orchestrator) (≥ v1.0.1) to dispatch work to per-parent peers (codex / gemini / grok in worktrees):
```python
from lib.dispatch import dispatch, record_outcome, check_previous_task
dispatch(worker='<your-session>-codex', task_id='...', description='...', supervisor='<your-session>')
```
Plan tracker REST API on :5002 — see [`taey-plan` + `taey-task` CLIs](https://github.com/palios-taey/claude-code-fleet-orchestrator).

